TRAP, recorded because it is the natural first guess and it is WRONG:
`Spec (ℚ̄ ⊗_ℚ ℚ̄)` is **not** `∐_{σ ∈ Γ_ℚ} Spec ℚ̄`.  The tensor product
is the ring of *continuous* functions `Γ_ℚ → ℚ̄`, so its spectrum is a
