`hN : 0 < N` matches `exists_isCoarseModuliY0_isSmoothCurve`: at `N = 0`
the coarse space is EMPTY (`isEmpty_of_isCoarseModuliY0_zero`) so the
clause holds vacuously there, and the branches are deliberately not merged.

